      "summary": "An island under the sea: corals, sunken barrels and a hoard for divers.",
      "description": "The sea took this island long ago. Dive down among the corals and the sunken barrels - there is loot for those who can hold their breath.\nTick 'Also turn up while sailing' when you download it to meet it by chance in your worlds.",
