      "author": "SwedenJohansson",
      "version": 1,
      "summary": "A short trip: an old camp, a treasure island its quest points to, and a wreck drifting by.",
      "description": "Palm Cove appears ahead as soon as the world starts. Finish the camp's quest and Treasure Cove appears 600 m to the north: find the map, find the X, open the chest. Reach it and a wreck drifts in from the east.\nRandom islands are off, so these are the only custom islands in the world.",
