    {
      "id": "castaways-trail",
      "path": "plans/castaways-trail",
      "kind": "plan",
      "title": "The Castaway's Trail",
      "author": "SwedenJohansson",
      "version": 1,
      "summary": "A short adventure: an empty camp, the smuggler's treasure its notes point to, and the rock a warden guards.",
      "description": "Castaway Camp appears ahead as the world starts. Read the notice board and search the supplies: the castaway's notes point to Smuggler's Cove to the north, where a map in a bottle leads to buried treasure. Reach the cove and a flat rock rises to the east - Warden's Rock, and something big guards its top. A wreck drifts by on the way.\nThree islands, two quests and a fight. Random islands are off, so these are the only custom islands in the world.",
